From ab1abff42e0280b44d5a813de51a75c22e673269 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenWorlds <openworlds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:54:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] java.net: sockets, name lookups, URL and HTTP

Socket and ServerSocket on BSD sockets (IPv4 TCP: connect with a timeout,
read timeouts, accept timeouts, options, the JDK's exceptions:
ConnectException, NoRouteToHostException, SocketTimeoutException);
InetAddress resolves with getaddrinfo (Inet4AddressImpl, no reflection);
URL parsed as the JDK's URLStreamHandler (it was a stub that threw);
URLConnection with request properties and header dates;
HttpURLConnection over a socket (GET, HEAD, POST, redirects, chunked and
length-delimited bodies, If-Modified-Since, the JDK's exceptions for 404
and other errors); file: URLs. Natives only built when used.
